const n='---\ntitle: "Promo API"\ndescription: "Admin endpoints for managing promo settings, agent tiers, promo agents and commission overview."\n---\n\n# Promo API\n\nThis document describes the admin-facing API for the `promo` module. These endpoints require administrator authentication.\n\n## Admin Endpoints\n\n### Promo Overview\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/admin/promo/overview`\n\nReturns overview metrics, recent agents, recent attributions and recent commissions.\n\n**Response Example:**\n\n```json\n{\n  "overview": {\n    "members": 12,\n    "agents": 4,\n    "masterAgents": 1,\n    "commissionAmount": 128.5,\n    "attributedOrders": 20\n  },\n  "agents": [],\n  "attributions": [],\n  "commissions": []\n}\n```\n\n### Promo Settings\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/admin/promo/settings`\n\nReturns persisted promo settings.\n\n**Response Example:**\n\n```json\n{\n  "promo_invite_reward_amount": "10"\n}\n```\n\n**Endpoint:** `POST /api/admin/promo/settings`\n\n**Request Body Example:**\n\n```json\n{\n  "promo_invite_reward_amount": "10"\n}\n```\n\n### Agent Tiers\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/admin/promo/tiers`\n\nReturns all configured agent tiers.\n\n**Endpoint:** `POST /api/admin/promo/tiers`\n\nCreates or updates an agent tier.\n\n**Request Body Example:**\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": "master-default",\n  "name": "Master Agent",\n  "roleScope": "master_agent",\n  "level": 100,\n  "discountRate": 0.8,\n  "salesThreshold": 0,\n  "isFixed": true,\n  "isActive": true,\n  "description": "Fixed discount for master agents"\n}\n```\n\n### Agents\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/admin/promo/agents?page=1&pageSize=15`\n\nReturns a paginated list of promo agents and master agents.\n\n**Endpoint:** `POST /api/admin/promo/agents`\n\nAssigns a user as `master_agent` or `agent` by email.\n\n**Request Body Example:**\n\n```json\n{\n  "email": "agent@example.com",\n  "role": "agent",\n  "parentAgentUserId": 12\n}\n```\n\n### Agent Relations\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/admin/promo/relations`\n\nReturns current promo agent relation records, including parent and master agent bindings.\n\n**Endpoint:** `PUT /api/admin/promo/relations/:id`\n\nUpdates the parent master agent for an existing child-agent relation.\n\n**Request Body Example:**\n\n```json\n{\n  "parentAgentUserId": 12\n}\n```\n\n**Endpoint:** `DELETE /api/admin/promo/relations/:id`\n\nDisables the agent relation and demotes the member back to a normal member. Master agents with active child agents cannot be removed.\n\n### Commissions\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/admin/promo/commissions?page=1&pageSize=15`\n\nReturns a paginated list of promo commission records.\n\n## User Endpoints\n\n### User Promo Overview\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/users/promo/overview`\n\nReturns current user\'s referral summary, promo links, promo codes and agent-role flags such as `isAgent` / `isMasterAgent`.\nWhen the user visits this endpoint for the first time, the backend will lazily create a promo member record and generate invite-related codes automatically.\nIf the user registers through a master-agent `agent` link, the system first creates a `promo_agent_relations.status = pending` relation. The user only joins the formal team after the master agent approves it.\n\n### User Invite Records\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/users/promo/invites`\n\nReturns invite records created by the current user.\n\n### User Team Records\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/users/promo/team`\n\nReturns formal child-agent team records visible to the current user and only includes `status = active` members.\n\n### Pending Agent Applicants\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/users/promo/pending`\n\nReturns pending child-agent applications under the current master agent and only includes `status = pending` records.\n\n**Endpoint:** `POST /api/users/promo/pending/:id`\n\nAllows the current master agent to review a pending child-agent request.\n\n**Request Body Example:**\n\n```json\n{\n  "action": "approve"\n}\n```\n\nSupported `action` values:\n\n- `approve`: promote the applicant into a formal child agent\n- `reject`: reject the request and mark the pending relation as `disabled`\n\n### User Commission Records\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/users/promo/commissions`\n\nReturns promo commission records owned by the current user.\n\n### Team Report\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/admin/promo/team-report?masterAgentUserId=12`\n\nReturns team summary and child-agent sales report for a given master agent.\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/users/promo/team-report`\n\nReturns the current master agent\'s team summary and child-agent sales report.\n\n### Team Orders\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/admin/promo/team-orders?masterAgentUserId=12`\n\nReturns attributed team order details for a given master agent.\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/users/promo/team-orders`\n\nReturns attributed team order details for the current master agent.\n';export{n as default};
